        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "The dangerous risks are the slow ones you can name but discount. Risk management here is the same discipline as anywhere \u2014 a portfolio, a power grid, a reef \u2014 name the risk before it names you, and respect the correlations.",
